    "detailed_description": "<h1>OTHER OUR GAMES</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1715369992\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1715369992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1715369992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><br>Sneaker Custom Simulator will allow you to sit in your own workshop, which you will be able to develop with new elements, tools and models of shoes along with the completion of subsequent orders.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/b60dbde6bd65e988e73c7a64599a81e4.avif?t=1715369992\" /></div><br>Each aspect of the game has been designed to best reflect the painting process. In addition to painting, we can also repair damaged shoes, clean them and, after painting, apply the necessary care impregnations.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/c59af136f05931393b7bd7982712169f.poster.avif?t=1715369992\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/c59af136f05931393b7bd7982712169f.webm?t=1715369992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/c59af136f05931393b7bd7982712169f.mp4?t=1715369992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/d818edcd7e1d1a2c87bb41e8dcee0ade.avif?t=1715369992\" /></div><br>By completing orders in the story mode, increase your skill level and earn to develop your workshop. Each order has specific requirements that we must meet in order to satisfy our clients.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/3e232283a7baa6281120c4112f10173b.poster.avif?t=1715369992\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/3e232283a7baa6281120c4112f10173b.webm?t=1715369992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/3e232283a7baa6281120c4112f10173b.mp4?t=1715369992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/a23b3e4363e9deee4c1ef148814328da.avif?t=1715369992\" /></div><br>The design mode will allow you to freely personalize shoes with access to all tools, save designs and export them to formats that are helpful for real customization.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/08a7cf2dbc45225e0261488b430d1731.poster.avif?t=1715369992\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/08a7cf2dbc45225e0261488b430d1731.webm?t=1715369992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/08a7cf2dbc45225e0261488b430d1731.mp4?t=1715369992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Do you personalize footwear? You are just starting out, or maybe you lack manual skills but would like to design your own shoes? Sneaker Custom Simulator will allow you to sit in your own workshop and create what you've always wanted!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1715369992\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1715369992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1715369992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><br>Sneaker Custom Simulator will allow you to sit in your own workshop, which you will be able to develop with new elements, tools and models of shoes along with the completion of subsequent orders.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/b60dbde6bd65e988e73c7a64599a81e4.avif?t=1715369992\" /></div><br>Each aspect of the game has been designed to best reflect the painting process. In addition to painting, we can also repair damaged shoes, clean them and, after painting, apply the necessary care impregnations.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/c59af136f05931393b7bd7982712169f.poster.avif?t=1715369992\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/c59af136f05931393b7bd7982712169f.webm?t=1715369992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/c59af136f05931393b7bd7982712169f.mp4?t=1715369992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/d818edcd7e1d1a2c87bb41e8dcee0ade.avif?t=1715369992\" /></div><br>By completing orders in the story mode, increase your skill level and earn to develop your workshop. Each order has specific requirements that we must meet in order to satisfy our clients.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/3e232283a7baa6281120c4112f10173b.poster.avif?t=1715369992\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/3e232283a7baa6281120c4112f10173b.webm?t=1715369992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/3e232283a7baa6281120c4112f10173b.mp4?t=1715369992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/a23b3e4363e9deee4c1ef148814328da.avif?t=1715369992\" /></div><br>The design mode will allow you to freely personalize shoes with access to all tools, save designs and export them to formats that are helpful for real customization.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/08a7cf2dbc45225e0261488b430d1731.poster.avif?t=1715369992\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/08a7cf2dbc45225e0261488b430d1731.webm?t=1715369992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868800/extras/08a7cf2dbc45225e0261488b430d1731.mp4?t=1715369992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Do you personalize footwear? You are just starting out, or maybe you lack manual skills but would like to design your own shoes? Sneaker Custom Simulator will allow you to sit in your own workshop and create what you've always wanted!",
